### Metrics Check
@orderServiceUrl = http://localhost:8081
@inventoryServiceUrl = http://localhost:8082
@paymentServiceUrl = http://localhost:8083


### ORDER SERVICE - business metrics

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.saga.created

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.saga.confirmed

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.saga.cancelled

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.saga.cancellation.started


### ORDER SERVICE - outbox publish counters

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.publish?tag=result:success

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.publish?tag=result:failed


### ORDER SERVICE - outbox gauges

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:pending

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:processing

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:published

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:failed

###

GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:dead


